  "name": {
    "@value": "C19 Diagnoses While Pregnant Dataset in A Prospective, Observational Study of HIV-Infected Pregnant Women and HIV-Exposed, Uninfected Children at Clinical Sites in Latin American Countries"
  },
  "description": {
    "@value": "New, ongoing, or resolved diagnoses in biological mother while pregnant (Static Cohort Maternal Information CRF)\nStudy Description\nDescribes the characteristics of HIV-infected pregnant women and their HIV-exposed, uninfected children at clinical sites in Latin America, including the utilization of interventions related to decreasing the risk of mother-to-child transmission. Biospecimens are available for request through DASH. Please navigate to Explore Biospecimens at the top of this page. HIV-infected women and their HIV-exposed uninfected children"
  },
